7          | 1         | 10.5', NULL, 'ordered', NULL, 'JOIN courses and enrollments, `GROUP BY` the course, `HAVING ...`. `COUNT(grade)` skips NULLs, `COUNT(*)` does not.', NULL, 'sql', 'sql-course-averages', 2.0, 'SELECT c.title, COUNT(e.grade) AS n, AVG(e.grade) AS average
