7          | 1         | 10.5', NULL, 'ordered', NULL, '`CASE WHEN grade IS NULL THEN ... WHEN grade >= 10 THEN ... ELSE ... END`. A comparison with NULL is never true, so NULL falls into the ELSE.', NULL, 'sql', 'sql-grade-status', 2.0, 'SELECT s.name, c.title,
