6        | 4          | 2', NULL, 'ordered', NULL, '`ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY category ORDER BY price DESC, name)` then keep `<= 2`. `RANK()` would give the same rank to tied products and return too many rows.', NULL, 'sql', 'sql-top2-per-category', 2.0, 'SELECT category, name, price FROM (
